  </h2>

  <p class="text-base text-[#575757] dark:text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
    Follow this step-by-step checklist to lock down your accounts today:
  </p>

  <ol class="list-decimal pl-6 space-y-2 text-base text-[#575757] dark:text-zinc-300 mb-4">
